; Issue: https://github.com/gHashTag/tt-trinity-phi/issues/100
; Status: EVALUATION ONLY, committed before any metadata change (commit f002d24). This header
; does not record results: whether parse, typecheck and the test blocks pass is shown only by the
; CI receipts (native t27c gate) of the commit in question; the physical verdict is UNKNOWN until
; the GDS run of the latest commit says so.
; This file is NOT acceptance of issue #100. The #100 target stays one 1x1 tile; a 1x2 result,
; even a fully green one, does not meet #100 and must never be reported as meeting it.
